Z||000004||Monkeyman||12-17-1999||10:09 PM||||Chevrolet is the largest division, but Pontiac puts out the best cars <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">.  If you're thinking that they are 2 separate entities, you might be getting "GM" and "GMC" confused.  GMC is the GM division that makes trucks.  And don't forget GMs financing division called "GMAC".  Confused yet?||||reg||1
