Z||000008||Monkeyman||12-18-1999||01:28 AM||||Glad to hear that it takes a bottle of Vodka to confuse you.  Some of us are able to get confused without alcohol.  BTW-DMC was also the maker of the Delorean who got a bad rap (as if any rap is good!)  It's funny you should bring up the "rap" subject since we've seen so many pics lately of cars that have been w-rap-ped around stuff.  It's obviously late. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by Monkeyman (edited 12-18-1999).]||||reg||1
